    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Scaled dot-product attention, one operation per node: softmax(mask(Q K^T / sqrt(d))) V. Six positions, each with an 8-d query, key and value. The scores matrix is 6x6: entry (i, j) says how much position i wants to read position j. The causal mask sets every entry above the diagonal to -inf, so after the softmax position i reads only positions 0..i. The heatmap shows the lower-triangular weights.\n\n縮放點積注意力，每個運算一顆節點：softmax(mask(Q K^T / sqrt(d))) V。共 6 個位置，每個位置各有 8 維的 query、key、value。分數矩陣是 6x6：第 (i, j) 格表示位置 i 想讀位置 j 的程度。因果遮罩把對角線以上的格子都設成 -inf，所以經過 softmax 後，位置 i 只會讀位置 0..i。熱圖顯示的就是這個下三角權重。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-scale",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 900,
        "y": 240
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "0.353553 = 1 / sqrt(8), with 8 the key dimension. Without it the dot products grow with the dimension and the softmax saturates to one-hot rows.\n\n0.353553 = 1 / sqrt(8)，8 是 key 的維度。少了這一步，點積會隨維度變大，softmax 就會飽和成幾乎 one-hot 的列。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "scale",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 240
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-mask",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 620,
        "y": -820
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "AttentionMask reads the sequence length from dim 0 of its tensor input, here Q with shape [6, 8], and returns a [6, 6] boolean matrix where True means blocked.\n\nAttentionMask 從輸入張量的第 0 維讀出序列長度，這裡接的是形狀 [6, 8] 的 Q，輸出 [6, 6] 的布林矩陣，True 代表擋住。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "mask",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -260
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
